			<string>Experimental: reads the open book aloud in your Spoken Content voice, turning pages as it goes. Tap a word to start reading from it, or tap the word being read to stop. With VoiceOver on, a two-finger double tap pauses and resumes. Reading continues with the screen locked. Turning it on takes effect at the next page turn.

